{"id":"wb-7-1800","name":"古德寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"古德寺","text":"古德寺，又名古德禅寺，是湖北省武汉市的一间佛寺，为武汉地区四大丛林之一。其位于江岸区二七街道黄埔路上滑坡（门牌）74号。寺庙几经战火，兴盛时期占地达30000多平方米，目前仅存天王殿、大雄宝殿等建筑，四围被二炮部队驻地、空军医院与其他民居包围。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E5%BE%B7%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":86856917,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856917","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/00778b6ff199f603f30a335b.jpg","title":"古德寺圆通殿2023.4_(1).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%A4%E5%BE%B7%E5%AF%BA%E5%9C%86%E9%80%9A%E6%AE%BF2023.4_(1).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/%E5%8F%A4%E5%BE%B7%E5%AF%BA%E5%9C%86%E9%80%9A%E6%AE%BF2023.4_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​湖北省武汉市江岸区 古德寺","width":320,"height":213}}